{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NfPkuu1qy3mGMYG2CL7udE","type":"tool_result","content":"{\r\n  \"id\": \"US-196\",\r\n  \"title\": \"Integrate channel manager for live OTA availability synchronisation\",\r\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Without a channel manager, Pelangi's rates and availability on Booking.com, Agoda, and Hostelworld are updated manually, risking overbookings and rate parity violations. A cloud-based channel manager (e.g., Beds24, Cloudbeds, or SiteMinder) synchronises ARI across all OTAs in real time and can power the website's own availability widget. This is also a prerequisite for Google Free Booking Links (which require a connectivity partner).\",\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    \"Channel manager account configured with Booking.com, Agoda, and Hostelworld connections\",\r\n    \"Two-way ARI sync is live: manual bookings on the website close availability on all OTAs within 2 minutes\",\r\n    \"Website availability calendar / date-picker pulls live inventory from the channel manager API\",\r\n    \"Zero overbooking incidents in the 30-day period following go-live\",\r\n    \"Channel manager is an approved Google Hotel Center connectivity partner (required for Google FBL story)\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"technicalNotes\": [\r\n    \"Agoda channel manager XML connection: https://e4jconnect.com/booking-channels/agoda\",\r\n    \"Agoda Onboarding API for connectivity partners: https://www.agodaconnectivity.com/documentation/onboarding-api\",\r\n    \"Recommended for small hostels: Beds24 (budget), Cloudbeds (mid-range), SiteMinder (enterprise)\",\r\n    \"AltexSoft hotel API guide: https://www.altexsoft.com/blog/hotel-api/\",\r\n    \"This story is a dependency for the Google Free Booking Links story\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"dependencies\": [],\r\n  \"estimatedComplexity\": \"large\",\r\n  \"passes\": false,\r\n  \"model\": \"haiku\",\r\n  \"last_attempted\": \"2026-04-13T19:17:15Z\"\r\n}\n[rerun: b1]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d90c97-f395-42af-a0ca-354a9893adb6","uuid":"0864c164-67c3-43ef-bdb8-0890a2d17996","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:18:00.391Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\r\n  \"id\": \"US-196\",\r\n  \"title\": \"Integrate channel manager for live OTA availability synchronisation\",\r\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Without a channel manager, Pelangi's rates and availability on Booking.com, Agoda, and Hostelworld are updated manually, risking overbookings and rate parity violations. A cloud-based channel manager (e.g., Beds24, Cloudbeds, or SiteMinder) synchronises ARI across all OTAs in real time and can power the website's own availability widget. This is also a prerequisite for Google Free Booking Links (which require a connectivity partner).\",\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    \"Channel manager account configured with Booking.com, Agoda, and Hostelworld connections\",\r\n    \"Two-way ARI sync is live: manual bookings on the website close availability on all OTAs within 2 minutes\",\r\n    \"Website availability calendar / date-picker pulls live inventory from the channel manager API\",\r\n    \"Zero overbooking incidents in the 30-day period following go-live\",\r\n    \"Channel manager is an approved Google Hotel Center connectivity partner (required for Google FBL story)\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"technicalNotes\": [\r\n    \"Agoda channel manager XML connection: https://e4jconnect.com/booking-channels/agoda\",\r\n    \"Agoda Onboarding API for connectivity partners: https://www.agodaconnectivity.com/documentation/onboarding-api\",\r\n    \"Recommended for small hostels: Beds24 (budget), Cloudbeds (mid-range), SiteMinder (enterprise)\",\r\n    \"AltexSoft hotel API guide: https://www.altexsoft.com/blog/hotel-api/\",\r\n    \"This story is a dependency for the Google Free Booking Links story\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"dependencies\": [],\r\n  \"estimatedComplexity\": \"large\",\r\n  \"passes\": false,\r\n  \"model\": \"haiku\",\r\n  \"last_attempted\": \"2026-04-13T19:17:15Z\"\r\n}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01AeZ2NF4mJNV7ikzbgrPPpC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the story US-196. Let me understand it:\n\n**Story:** US-196 - \"Integrate channel manager for live OTA availability synchronisation\"\n**Priority:** high\n**Status:** passes = false\n\n**Description:**\n- Pelangi needs a channel manager to sync rates and availability on Booking.com, Agoda, Hostelworld\n- Currently manual updates risk overbookings and rate parity violations\n- Channel manager (Beds24, Cloudbeds, SiteMinder) syncs ARI (Availability Rate Inventory) across OTAs\n- Can power website's availability widget\n- Prerequisite for Google Free Booking Links\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n1. Channel manager account configured with Booking.com, Agoda, Hostelworld connections\n2. Two-way ARI sync live: manual bookings on website close availability on all OTAs within 2 minutes\n3. Website availability calendar/date-picker pulls live inventory from channel manager API\n4. Zero overbooking incidents in 30-day period after go-live\n5. Channel manager is approved Google Hotel Center connectivity partner\n\n**Technical Notes:**\n- Agoda XML connection link\n- Agoda Onboarding API link\n- Recommended services: Beds24, Cloudbeds, SiteMinder\n- AltexSoft hotel API guide\n- Dependency for Google Free Booking Links story\n\n**Dependencies:** None listed\n\nNow I need to check the actual codebase structure. The progress.txt mentions this should be implemented in `pelangi_hospitality` Frappe app. Let me check the current project structure.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1545,"cache_read_input_tokens":72409,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1545},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d90c97-f395-42af-a0ca-354a9893adb6","uuid":"38fef93b-c9f2-44e3-bfe7-a18d8cbf67ec"}
