{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q9BFEoCXsTNrMLrzoSF8UA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# CLAUDE.md — Projects Workspace\n2\t\n3\tMulti-project workspace containing 30+ web apps for cafe operations, hostel management, financial tools, and business utilities.\n4\t\n5\t## Primary Project: Rainbow AI (PelangiManager-Zeabur)\n6\t\n7\tWhatsApp AI assistant for Pelangi Capsule Hostel. See `PelangiManager-Zeabur/CLAUDE.md` for full reference.\n8\t\n9\t## Tech Stack (Consistent Across Projects)\n10\t\n11\t**Frontend:** React 18-19 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + TanStack Query + Wouter\n12\t**Backend:** Node.js 20+ + Express + PostgreSQL (Neon) + Drizzle ORM + Passport.js\n13\t**Testing:** Vitest/Jest + Playwright (E2E)\n14\t**DevOps:** Docker, AWS Amplify, Vercel, Railway, Zeabur\n15\t\n16\t## Project Categories\n17\t\n18\t| Category | Projects |\n19\t|----------|----------|\n20\t| **AI Assistant** | **PelangiManager-Zeabur** (Rainbow AI) |\n21\t| Cafe Operations | MakanManager, CafeTaskFlow, Cafe Menu Master |\n22\t| Hostel/Logistics | PelangiManager, Melody WMS, pelangi-website |\n23\t| Financial | AI Financial planner |\n24\t| Knowledge | Obsidian-vault |\n25\t\n26\t## Key Documentation\n27\t\n28\t- `PelangiManager-Zeabur/CLAUDE.md` — Rainbow AI full reference\n29\t- `MakanManager/README.md` — Comprehensive (636 lines)\n30\t- `Cafe Menu Master/.agent/workflows/architecture.md` — Architecture docs\n31\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d90c97-f395-42af-a0ca-354a9893adb6","uuid":"68cdd942-f24a-4fdb-a413-701e4799d07e","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:19:26.545Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\CLAUDE.md","content":"# CLAUDE.md — Projects Workspace\n\nMulti-project workspace containing 30+ web apps for cafe operations, hostel management, financial tools, and business utilities.\n\n## Primary Project: Rainbow AI (PelangiManager-Zeabur)\n\nWhatsApp AI assistant for Pelangi Capsule Hostel. See `PelangiManager-Zeabur/CLAUDE.md` for full reference.\n\n## Tech Stack (Consistent Across Projects)\n\n**Frontend:** React 18-19 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + TanStack Query + Wouter\n**Backend:** Node.js 20+ + Express + PostgreSQL (Neon) + Drizzle ORM + Passport.js\n**Testing:** Vitest/Jest + Playwright (E2E)\n**DevOps:** Docker, AWS Amplify, Vercel, Railway, Zeabur\n\n## Project Categories\n\n| Category | Projects |\n|----------|----------|\n| **AI Assistant** | **PelangiManager-Zeabur** (Rainbow AI) |\n| Cafe Operations | MakanManager, CafeTaskFlow, Cafe Menu Master |\n| Hostel/Logistics | PelangiManager, Melody WMS, pelangi-website |\n| Financial | AI Financial planner |\n| Knowledge | Obsidian-vault |\n\n## Key Documentation\n\n- `PelangiManager-Zeabur/CLAUDE.md` — Rainbow AI full reference\n- `MakanManager/README.md` — Comprehensive (636 lines)\n- `Cafe Menu Master/.agent/workflows/architecture.md` — Architecture docs\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_015xPtChxmajtsy9cn6PTAot","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So pelangi-website is classified as a \"Hostel/Logistics\" project and uses the React/Express stack. This is a Next.js website. \n\nGiven that US-196 is about \"channel manager integration\" for OTA availability sync, and this is a Next.js website, I need to:\n\n1. Create a backend API endpoint to interact with a channel manager (like Beds24)\n2. Integrate it with the booking system\n3. Sync availability with OTAs\n\nThis is a very large task. Looking at the story again, it says this is \"large\" complexity. The progress.txt pre-analysis was for a Frappe app which doesn't apply here.\n\nActually, I realize I'm looking at the last_attempted timestamp: `\"2026-04-13T19:17:15Z\"` which was yesterday. This story has been attempted before and marked as failed (`passes: false`).\n\nGiven the scope of this story (large complexity, integrating with external channel managers like Beds24, implementing 2-way sync with 3 OTAs, etc.), I think I need to:\n\n1. Determine what a \"minimal viable implementation\" would be for this story\n2. Check if there's already any work started on this\n\nLet me search for any existing channel manager or OTA sync related files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":81829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":659},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d90c97-f395-42af-a0ca-354a9893adb6","uuid":"ff99a466-8207-4e2d-a712-b171012c39cb"}
