{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rc5qDtmT7BVgJns4SPKyKN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"use server\";\n2\t\n3\timport { refresh } from \"next/cache\";\n4\t\n5\t/**\n6\t * Fetches fresh uncached room availability data without busting the cache.\n7\t * Call this from client components that need to poll or display live\n8\t * availability without a full page reload or cache invalidation.\n9\t *\n10\t * Unlike revalidateTag/revalidatePath which purge the cache entry,\n11\t * refresh() fetches fresh dynamic data for the current render only,\n12\t * leaving the cached version intact for other users.\n13\t */\n14\texport async function refreshAvailability(): Promise<void> {\n15\t  refresh();\n16\t}\n17\t\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6d90c97-f395-42af-a0ca-354a9893adb6","uuid":"b0a499c3-5810-4974-ad9a-dec05acc4c57","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:19:42.862Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\actions\\availability.ts","content":"\"use server\";\n\nimport { refresh } from \"next/cache\";\n\n/**\n * Fetches fresh uncached room availability data without busting the cache.\n * Call this from client components that need to poll or display live\n * availability without a full page reload or cache invalidation.\n *\n * Unlike revalidateTag/revalidatePath which purge the cache entry,\n * refresh() fetches fresh dynamic data for the current render only,\n * leaving the cached version intact for other users.\n */\nexport async function refreshAvailability(): Promise<void> {\n  refresh();\n}\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
