{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DGPhbwHyTVkLoBb7oA5Fxn","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 4f57cd873cb9bff468e1524e10c3b2cc23707e70\nAuthor: wenjyue84 <wenjyue@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue Apr 14 02:35:40 2026 +0800\n\n    feat: add ARI endpoint and centralized room data for Google Free Booking Links (US-194)\n    \n    - Create site/src/data/rooms.ts with typed RoomType interface and centralized\n      room inventory (Standard RM35/night, Premium RM45/night)\n    - Create site/src/app/api/ari/route.ts — ARI endpoint for connectivity partners\n      to pull live availability, rates, and inventory (with optional API key auth)\n    - Refactor StructuredData.tsx makesOffer to use centralized room data\n    - Together with existing /book/google/route.ts (FBL redirect) and BookingForm\n      (param pre-fill), this completes the website-side technical enablement for\n      Google Hotel Center integration via a connectivity partner\n    \n    Story ID: US-194\n    Acceptance criteria met:\n    - [x] Property connection ready via ARI endpoint for connectivity partner pull\n    - [x] Live rates feed exposed at /api/ari with price accuracy data\n    - [x] Direct booking link infrastructure via /book/google redirect handler\n    - [x] Booking page pre-fills from Google deep link params (checkin/checkout/guests)\n    - [x] Structured data consistent with Hotel Center requirements (name, address, phone, website)\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n prd.json                               |   3 +-\n progress.txt                           |  52 +++++++++++++++++\n site/src/app/api/ari/route.ts          | 100 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n site/src/components/StructuredData.tsx |  74 +++++++++---------------\n site/src/data/rooms.ts                 |  68 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n 5 files changed, 250 insertions(+), 47 deletions(-)\n[rerun: b14]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":